Steps:
[SETUP] POST a configuration-1 setup for {{ident}}; [CAPTURE] the token tail → TOKEN_EARLY
[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/connect/token grant_type=punchout&session_token={{TOKEN_EARLY}}&storeId={{store1}}
[SETUP] POST a second configuration-1 setup; [CAPTURE] the token tail → TOKEN_LATE
[WAIT] {{tokenMinutes}} minutes plus 10 seconds
[HTTP] POST {{BACK_URL}}/connect/token grant_type=punchout&session_token={{TOKEN_LATE}}&storeId={{store1}}

